---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();

const pillars = [
  { name: '机场推荐', href: '/jichang/' },
  { name: '便宜机场', href: '/cheap/' },
  { name: 'VPN 评测', href: '/vpn/' },
  { name: 'Clash 配置', href: '/clash/' },
  { name: '节点测速', href: '/nodes/' },
  { name: '梯子防坑', href: '/tizi/' },
  { name: '免费资源', href: '/free/' },
  { name: '使用教程', href: '/tutorial/' },
  { name: '品牌档案库', href: '/brands/' },
  { name: '月付机场', href: '/monthly/' },
  { name: '流量套餐', href: '/plans/' },
  { name: '机场避坑', href: '/avoid/' }
];
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 pt-12 pb-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800">
      <!-- 品牌与独立第三方声明 -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <img
            src="/avatar.jpg"
            alt="便宜机场"
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg object-cover border border-slate-700"
            width="32"
            height="32"
          />
          <span class="font-bold text-white text-base sm:text-lg">便宜机场 (pianyijichang.world)</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          面向预算有限、初次购买代理或寻找稳定日常备用路线的中文用户，提供真实机场价格、套餐对比、流量规则、使用限制与科学选购依据。
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-3.5 border border-slate-700/80 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-emerald-400 block mb-1">【独立第三方中立声明】</strong>
          本站为完全独立的第三方代理技术信息与选购核验资料库，与任何被列出之机场品牌不存在股权隶属、从属运营或联合控制关系。全站数据严格依据公开商户信息、第三方监测与本站客观测试日志采信。
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 栏目导航 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-3.5 text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">主业务栏目</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 list-none p-0 m-0 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          {pillars.map((p) => (
            <li>
              <a href={p.href} class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
                {p.name}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 合规指南与免责条款 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-3.5 text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">合规规范与透明度</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 list-none p-0 m-0 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/about/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300">
              关于本站、商业披露与评测方法
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
              隐私权政策 (Privacy Policy)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
              服务条款与免责声明 (Terms)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/search/" class="hover:text-white">
              Pagefind 静态检索库
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/avoid/" class="hover:text-white">
              跑路预警与争议黑名单
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-white">
              Sitemap 站点地图
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 pt-3">
          <p class="mb-1 text-amber-300 font-semibold">合规底线警示：</p>
          <p class="m-0 leading-normal">
            本站坚决禁止提供翻越防火长城/绕过审查的具体操作步骤；坚决不提供任何真实可用节点地址或订阅链接。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 底部版权与披露 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1">
        <span>© {currentYear} pianyijichang.world 便宜机场.</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">隐私政策</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">服务条款</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">关于我们</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>静态内容架构驱动.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center sm:text-right">
        <span>商业披露：全站外部注册链接含商业推荐参数，可能为本站带来推荐报酬，但绝不影响用户实付价格。</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
